    "finalName": "",
    "description": "Choose one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon\">Exotic Weapon</a> or one of the following weapon groups: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapons\" title=\"Advanced Melee\">Advanced Melee</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heavy_Weapons\" title=\"Heavy Weapons\">Heavy Weapons</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pistols\" title=\"Pistols\">Pistols</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rifles\" title=\"Rifles\">Rifles</a>, or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Simple_Weapons\" title=\"Simple Weapons\">Simple Weapons</a>. You gain a +2 bonus on damage rolls with the chosen <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon\">Exotic Weapon</a> or a weapon from the chosen group. This bonus stacks with the bonus granted by the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Specialization\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Specialization\">Weapon Specialization</a></b> Talent.<br><br>You may select this Talent multiple times. Each time you select this Talent, it applies to a different <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon\">Exotic Weapon</a> or weapon group.",
